   "id": "2109395167224480062",
   "text": "Remember when action choreography was good and felt like the actors were really trying to get eachother?\n\nThink The Transporter, The Matrix, The Raid, most Jackie Chan or Jet Li movies etc.\n\nNow they are just silly and showy nonsense just like the 70s but with less slo-mo",
